{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and take object if in reach. Move if not. Approach it if visible. Check properties.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = isObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = isObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = isObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
    "BT": {
